<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Each crate is opened in a designated staging area, and the contents are placed on a clean, flat surface.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The items are then cross‑checked with the bilty: every item’s serial number and quantity must match the record.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Any deviation is documented with photographs and a written note.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Once verified, the items are moved to their respective storage zones.</span></li></ul>

<ul>
<li>For electrical gear, connect to a calibrated power source and perform a voltage check.</li>
<li>Mechanical components undergo a functional test—run the motor, verify gear ratios, and confirm torque specifications.</li>
<li>All electronic devices are powered on, and software diagnostics are run to ensure firmware integrity.</li>
</ul>

<p>After testing, the furniture is placed on a pre‑measured grid to maintain uniform spacing. Clean surfaces are wiped with a microfiber cloth before the furniture is positioned to avoid scratches.</p>
<p>The final step is the removal of packing debris: all cardboard, bubble wrap, and protective films are collected and disposed of in designated recycling bins. A quick sweep of the staging area ensures no foreign objects remain, and the space is ready for the next phase of setup.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



